<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Error - Battery Store</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1a1f36 100%);
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .error-container {
            background: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .error-icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #ef4444;
        }

        .error-container h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .error-container h2 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .error-description {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .btn-back {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #10b981;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            background-color: #059669;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-icon">⚠️</div>
        <h1>Oops! Error</h1>
        <h2>An error occurred while processing your request.</h2>
        <div class="error-description">
            <p>We apologize for the inconvenience. An unexpected error has occurred in the Battery Store system. Please try again or contact support if the problem persists.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="btn-back">← Go Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
